# E §3.1 step 1 and L §8.3 (tally 2.1.3, issue #60): loose files in one folder, given as n.tally then m.tally, print and
# hash in full-path order, m.tally then n.tally, each named as given. (A twin: their base names are their full paths,
# so on tally 2.1.2's refcore too.)
=== options disk reprint
=== n.tally
part p
  tally 2

input z: int
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
